{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tiket-sales-api-collection",
    "name": "TIKET SALES API",
    "description": "Koleksi lengkap semua endpoint API Tiket Sales. Server berjalan di http://localhost:8000.\n\n## Cara Penggunaan\n1. Import file ini ke Postman / Postman di VS Code\n2. Pastikan variable `baseUrl` = `http://localhost:8000` (sudah diset)\n3. Login dulu via POST /auth/ (admin) atau POST /auth/user (user)\n4. Salin token dari response ke variable `adminToken` atau `userToken`\n5. Semua endpoint protected sudah otomatis pakai variable token tersebut di header Authorization\n\n## Catatan Migrasi\nJika tabel reviews / subdistricts belum ada, jalankan: npx sequelize-cli db:migrate\n\n## Daftar Endpoint\n- AUTH: 2 endpoint\n- USER: 11 endpoint\n- EVENT: 8 endpoint\n- SEAT: 7 endpoint\n- TICKET: 5 endpoint\n- DISKON: 5 endpoint\n- REVIEW: 3 endpoint\n- SUBDISTRICT: 5 endpoint\n\nTotal: 46 endpoint",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": "PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "userToken",
      "value": "PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 AUTH",
      "description": "Endpoint autentikasi. Tidak membutuhkan token.\n\nFile: routes/auth.route.js\nController: controllers/auth.controller.js",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", ""]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Login sebagai Admin. Response berisi JWT token dengan role 'admin'. Salin token ke variable adminToken.\n\nRoute: POST /auth/\nController: authenticate\nMiddleware: -"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login User",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/user",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "user"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Login sebagai User biasa. Response berisi JWT token dengan role 'user'. Salin token ke variable userToken.\n\nRoute: POST /auth/user\nController: authenticateUser\nMiddleware: -"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👤 USER",
      "description": "Manajemen data pengguna. Prefix: /user\n\nFile: routes/user.route.js\nController: controllers/user.controller.js\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles, validateUser",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User Baru [PUBLIC]",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "register"]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstname\": \"Budi\",\n  \"lastname\": \"Santoso\",\n  \"email\": \"budi@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Registrasi akun user baru. Tidak butuh token (public). Validasi input menggunakan express-validator.\n\nRoute: POST /user/register\nController: registerUser\nMiddleware: validateUser"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Semua User [Admin]",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", ""]
            },
            "description": "Ambil semua data user. Hanya Admin.\n\nRoute: GET /user/\nController: getAllUser\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Profile Sendiri [Admin & User]",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Ambil profil diri sendiri dari JWT token. Admin & user bisa akses.\n\nRoute: GET /user/profile\nController: getUserProfile\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin', 'user')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Profile by ID [Admin & User]",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/profile/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "profile", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "description": "Ambil profil user berdasarkan ID. Admin bisa lihat semua, user hanya bisa lihat profil sendiri.\n\nRoute: GET /user/profile/:id\nController: getUserProfile\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin', 'user')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cari User by Key (via /search) [Admin]",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/search/:key",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "search", ":key"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "key", "value": "budi" }]
            },
            "description": "Cari user berdasarkan nama, email, atau role. Hanya Admin. Ini adalah rute eksplisit /search/:key.\n\nRoute: GET /user/search/:key\nController: findUser\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cari User by Key (via /:key) [Admin]",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/:key",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", ":key"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "key", "value": "budi" }]
            },
            "description": "Cari user berdasarkan keyword (alternatif dari /user/search/:key). Controller yang sama: findUser. Hanya Admin.\n\nRoute: GET /user/:key\nController: findUser\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tambah User [Admin]",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", ""]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstname\": \"Siti\",\n  \"lastname\": \"Rahayu\",\n  \"email\": \"siti@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Tambah user baru oleh Admin. Field 'role' opsional, default 'user'.\n\nRoute: POST /user/\nController: addUser\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User [Admin]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstname\": \"Siti\",\n  \"lastname\": \"Rahayu Updated\",\n  \"email\": \"siti.updated@example.com\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Update data user berdasarkan ID. Hanya Admin. Field password opsional — jika diisi, akan di-hash ulang.\n\nRoute: PUT /user/:id\nController: updateUser\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password User [Admin]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/reset-password/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "reset-password", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"password\": \"newpassword123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Reset password user berdasarkan ID. Hanya Admin.\n\nRoute: PUT /user/reset-password/:id\nController: resetPassword\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Hapus User [Admin]",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "description": "Hapus user berdasarkan ID. Hanya Admin.\n\nRoute: DELETE /user/:id\nController: deleteUser\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin')"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Batalkan Tiket via User Route [Admin & User]",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/ticket/cancel/:id",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["user", "ticket", "cancel", ":id"],
              "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "1" }]
            },
            "description": "Batalkan tiket via route user. Admin & user bisa akses. Mendelegasikan ke ticket controller cancelTicket.\n\nRoute: DELETE /user/ticket/cancel/:id\nController: cancelTicket (delegasi ke ticket.controller.cancelTicket)\nMiddleware: authorize, allowRoles('admin', 'user')"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
